{"3848660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Perception: Heart and Mind", "steam_appid": 3848660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;A unique action-adventure game where every reaction shapes a meaningful story.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The green community of Rootbranch 12 is perched atop a mountain at an altitude of 3,110 meters, embraced intermittently by permanent misty clouds. It is built on a giant Oak tree! This small community has undergone significant changes recently. Often, the darker side of each resident prevails, making the entire situation go from bad to worse. The Oak tree grieves silently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848660/extras/1e8c06ad01432db2f49499ca0e203c34.avif?t=1787816909\" width=617 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you save Rootbranch 12? Can your positive energy and light dispel the shadows, or will malice prevail?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 2D side-scrolling game focuses on precision platforming, mental and physical combat, and perception-reaction choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848660/extras/46d04ca7bbaf14b950250444dafa6c63.poster.avif?t=1787816909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848660/extras/46d04ca7bbaf14b950250444dafa6c63.webm?t=1787816909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848660/extras/46d04ca7bbaf14b950250444dafa6c63.mp4?t=1787816909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical attacks on robots with an upgradeable iron crowbar and mental attacks on shadows with the positive magnetic field that dominates the hero at that moment, that of the heart or the mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how you perceive the world, raise the corresponding perception, and earn points to improve your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative reaction system:</strong> It encourages players to react naturally—either from the heart or the mind—without revealing their response in advance. Essentially, it forces players to predict their reactions as in real life, along with the irreversible consequences that follow. This encourages guesswork and inference, prompting questions like, 'What is my heart telling me now? And what comes to my mind? Perhaps I need more time…’</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include an original soundtrack with 37 unique tracks with several handmade sounds, RPG elements, item collection and usage, unpredictable NPC behavior, different ways to progress, multi-direction combat, environmental puzzles, a day-night cycle, weapon upgrades, a philosophical story approach and multiple endings. Also there are 2 mini games, an addictive single and two player football and a slime ball game with 8 stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;A unique action-adventure game where every reaction shapes a meaningful story.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The green community of Rootbranch 12 is perched atop a mountain at an altitude of 3,110 meters, embraced intermittently by permanent misty clouds. It is built on a giant Oak tree! This small community has undergone significant changes recently. Often, the darker side of each resident prevails, making the entire situation go from bad to worse. The Oak tree grieves silently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848660/extras/1e8c06ad01432db2f49499ca0e203c34.avif?t=1787816909\" width=617 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you save Rootbranch 12? Can your positive energy and light dispel the shadows, or will malice prevail?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 2D side-scrolling game focuses on precision platforming, mental and physical combat, and perception-reaction choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848660/extras/46d04ca7bbaf14b950250444dafa6c63.poster.avif?t=1787816909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848660/extras/46d04ca7bbaf14b950250444dafa6c63.webm?t=1787816909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848660/extras/46d04ca7bbaf14b950250444dafa6c63.mp4?t=1787816909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical attacks on robots with an upgradeable iron crowbar and mental attacks on shadows with the positive magnetic field that dominates the hero at that moment, that of the heart or the mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how you perceive the world, raise the corresponding perception, and earn points to improve your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative reaction system:</strong> It encourages players to react naturally—either from the heart or the mind—without revealing their response in advance. Essentially, it forces players to predict their reactions as in real life, along with the irreversible consequences that follow. This encourages guesswork and inference, prompting questions like, 'What is my heart telling me now? And what comes to my mind? Perhaps I need more time…’</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include an original soundtrack with 37 unique tracks with several handmade sounds, RPG elements, item collection and usage, unpredictable NPC behavior, different ways to progress, multi-direction combat, environmental puzzles, a day-night cycle, weapon upgrades, a philosophical story approach and multiple endings. Also there are 2 mini games, an addictive single and two player football and a slime ball game with 8 stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Perception: Heart and Mind is an action-adventure game featuring engaging platforming, mental and physical combat, and meaningful choices driven by either your heart or mind. Navigate a dangerous, interconnected world and confront the unpredictable behavior of Rootbranch's residents. Try the Demo!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848660/f4afa0a2b920b7beef210ef448f46c976c8bdb66/header.jpg?t=1787816909", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848660/f84d7818a5b7c6be7c7a609b69f39364aa6522f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787816909", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848660/f84d7818a5b7c6be7c7a609b69f39364aa6522f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787816909", "website": "https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/3848660/view/500579345320902730", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 650 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor a